 in 2024 with a 17-year-old, putting the congresswoman's family back in the spotlight.\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6EE4EA63AF60DB1A432E13956D4C3ABF2E159E0EBBE1BC7C3BE21135456CE322/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w124_h124_faces;quality_90/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnbc_news_122%2Fb2f1c8350c7f525ad22d8da3dbca1800\",\"title\":\"Boebert's son faces exploitation charges\",\"url\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/news/us/articles/lauren-boebert-21-old-son-000707544.html\"},{\"bypassModal\":false,\"id\":\"bc330c4f-e69d-39fb-a00c-fae102fed887\",\"newStory\":false,\"position\":2,\"scoutQueries\":[{\"__typename\":\"ScoutQuery\",\"scoutExploreUrl\":\"https://scout.yahoo.com/chat?q=%22Tell%20me%20more%20about%20Anne%20Hathaway%20pokes%20fun%20at%20fake%20baby%20bump%20theories%22\u0026fr=news-yoh-sctq\u0026fr2=p:news,v:yoh,m:sctq\",\"displayQuestion\":\"Why did Anne Hathaway address pregnancy rumors?\",\"scoutQueryUrl\":\"https://scout.yahoo.com/chat?q=Why%20did%20Anne%20Hathaway%20address%20pregnancy%20rumors%3F\u0026fr=news-yoh-sctq\u0026fr2=p:news,v:yoh,m:sctq\u0026referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yahoo.com%2Fentertainment%2Fcelebrity%2Farticles%2Fanne-hathaway-claps-back-internet-225204959.html\u0026context=The%20actress%20answered%20critics%20after%20her%20premiere%20look%20set%20off%20fresh%20pregnancy%20speculation%2C%20and%20fans%20are%20also%20fixated%20on%20her%20maternity%20style%20as%20she%20promotes%20'The%20End%20of%20Oak%20Street'.\"}],\"summary\":\"The actress answered critics after her premiere look set off fresh pregnancy speculation, and fans are also fixated on her maternity style as she promotes 'The End of Oak Street'.\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/817DD4D3EAEC737FEA21E0A30EA83DE7C198A1626BED9F1447BF098E18FE9B71/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w124_h124_faces;quality_90/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fentertainment_weekly_785%2F49160f64bd69b2ca73f9d6fac0f310ba\",\"title\":\"Anne Hathaway pokes fun at baby bump theories \",\"url\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/celebrity/articles/anne-hathaway-claps-back-internet-225204959.html\"},{\"bypassModal\":false,\"id\":\"de018b80-3cd5-3570-9d2e-7bf50fe56c49\",\"newStory\":false,\"position\":1,\"scoutQueries\":[{\"__typename\":\"ScoutQuery\",\"scoutExploreUrl\":\"https://scout.yahoo.com/chat?q=%22Tell%20me%20more%20about%20Colombia%20searches%20for%20earthquake%20missing%22\u0026fr=news-yoh-sctq\u0026fr2=p:news,v:yoh,m:sctq\",\"displayQuestion\":\"Where are rescuers searching for missing people?\",\"scoutQueryUrl\":\"https://scout.yahoo.com/chat?q=Where%20are%20rescuers%20searching%20for%20missing%20people%3F\u0026fr=news-yoh-sctq\u0026fr2=p:news,v:yoh,m:sctq\u0026referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yahoo.com%2Fnews%2Fworld%2Farticles%2Fcolombia-searches-missing-powerful-earthquake-042416729.html\u0026context=Rescuers%20keep%20digging%20through%20rubble%20after%20a%207.4-magnitude%20quake%20left%20entire%20towns%20searching%20for%20loved%20ones%20and%20damaged%20or%20collapsed%20about%201%2C600%20buildings.%20The%20death%20toll%20is%20still%20climbing%2C%20with%20mayors%20and%20governors%20reporting%20far%20more%20deaths%20than%20the%20federal%20count.\"}],\"summary\":\"Rescuers keep digging through rubble after a 7.4-magnitude quake left entire towns searching for loved ones and damaged or collapsed about 1,600 buildings. The death toll is still climbing, with mayors and governors reporting far more deaths than the federal count.\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/68C211186C7355E6DCBBE189095E75E318B7339E35F42CC6CBA376D67A66FE73/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w124_h124_faces;quality_90/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnbcu_713%2F059993c26c24d729da1940aa48e66036\",\"title\":\"Colombia quake death toll rises \",\"url\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/news/world/articles/lt--colombia-earthquake-042416729.html\"},{\"bypassModal\":false,\"id\":\"41890c60-b792-3c93-b3ec-396b8803e2f8\",\"newStory\":false,\"position\":1,\"scoutQueries\"